+# CLOSE WITH LINE FIXES — 19 RESOLVED, 6 STILL TRACKING, 0 NEW
+
+The r3 repair is closeable with the ten exact fixes at the end of this report. I read all 25 r2 keys beside their cited source passages under the r1 rule: a new carrier, viewpoint, or scene position does not resolve a key while the source passage's internal chain remains. Nineteen keys now resolve; six still track. I found no separate new tracked passage outside the keyed set. Two additional line fixes repair continuity seams created by outright cuts.
